{# Initials-avatar partial. Reused by the sidebar footer chip and the
   self-service profile page so the colour + initials are computed in one
   place (UserAvatarExtension).

   Contract:
     @var user  App\Entity\User  the user to render an avatar for
     @var size  string           'sm' (default, h-10 w-10) or 'lg' (h-24 w-24)

   Colour is deterministic per email (crc32 mod palette length) so the
   same user always gets the same colour across pages and refreshes.
   Initials: first two chars of `name`, fallback to first two chars of
   `email`. Uppercased.

   No external assets, no DB column — purely visual placeholder.
#}
{% set dim = size == 'lg' ? 'h-24 w-24 text-2xl' : 'h-10 w-10 text-sm' %}
<span class="flex {{ dim }} shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-{{ user_avatar_color(user) }} font-semibold text-stone-50 select-none"
      aria-hidden="true">{{ user_initials(user) }}</span>